{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen","level":"B1","topic":"Wortschatz","title":{"de":"Vermutungen: wahrscheinlich, vielleicht, vermutlich","bn":"অনুমান প্রকাশ করা"},"summary":"সম্ভবত, হয়তো: wahrscheinlich, vielleicht, vermutlich।","sections":[{"heading":"অনুমানের শব্দ","blocks":[{"kind":"list","items":["wahrscheinlich — সম্ভবত","vielleicht — হয়তো","vermutlich — অনুমান করা যায় / সম্ভবত"]},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Wahrscheinlich wird es morgen regnen.","en":"It will probably rain tomorrow.","bn":"সম্ভবত আগামীকাল বৃষ্টি হবে।"},{"de":"Vielleicht komme ich später.","en":"Maybe I will come later.","bn":"হয়তো আমি পরে আসব।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এই শব্দ বাক্যের শুরুতে এলে পরেই verb আসে: Wahrscheinlich wird es …"}]},{"heading":"আরও উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Vermutlich ist er schon zu Hause.","en":"Presumably he is already at home.","bn":"সম্ভবত সে এর মধ্যেই বাসায় পৌঁছে গেছে।"},{"de":"Sie ist wahrscheinlich krank.","en":"She is probably ill.","bn":"সে সম্ভবত অসুস্থ।"},{"de":"Der Bus kommt vielleicht zu spät.","en":"The bus may be late.","bn":"বাসটি হয়তো দেরিতে আসবে।"},{"de":"Vielleicht hat er unsere Nachricht nicht gelesen.","en":"Maybe he has not read our message.","bn":"হয়তো সে আমাদের মেসেজটি পড়েনি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"ich glaube, dass … দিয়েও অনুমান বলা যায় (dass-অংশে verb শেষে):"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich glaube, dass sie heute nicht kommt.","en":"I think that she is not coming today.","bn":"আমার মনে হয়, সে আজ আসবে না।"}]}]}],"part":4,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„wahrscheinlich“ মানে কী?","options":["সম্ভবত","কখনো না","অবশ্যই"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wahrscheinlich = সম্ভবত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„vielleicht“ মানে কী?","options":["সবসময়","হয়তো","কখনো না"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vielleicht = হয়তো।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wahrscheinlich ___ es morgen regnen.","options":["wird","es wird","werden"],"answer":0,"explanation":"শুরুতে wahrscheinlich, তারপর verb: wird es।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„vermutlich“ মানে কী?","options":["অনুমান করা যায় / সম্ভবত","নিশ্চিতভাবে","গতকাল"],"answer":0,"explanation":"vermutlich = সম্ভবত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Vielleicht komme ich später.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি অবশ্যই পরে আসব।","হয়তো আমি পরে আসব।","আমি আগে এসেছিলাম।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vielleicht = হয়তো।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Vielleicht ich komme morgen.","Vielleicht komme ich morgen.","Vielleicht morgen ich komme."],"answer":1,"explanation":"শুরুতে vielleicht, তারপর verb।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„wahrscheinlich“ মানে কী?","options":["সম্ভবত","কখনো না","অবশ্যই"],"answer":0,"explanation":"wahrscheinlich = সম্ভবত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„vielleicht“ মানে কী?","options":["সবসময়","হয়তো","কখনো না"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vielleicht = হয়তো।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wahrscheinlich ___ es morgen regnen.","options":["wird","es wird","werden"],"answer":0,"explanation":"শুরুতে wahrscheinlich, তারপর verb: wird es।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„vermutlich“ মানে কী?","options":["অনুমান করা যায় / সম্ভবত","নিশ্চিতভাবে","গতকাল"],"answer":0,"explanation":"vermutlich = সম্ভবত।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Vielleicht komme ich später.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি অবশ্যই পরে আসব।","হয়তো আমি পরে আসব।","আমি আগে এসেছিলাম।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"vielleicht = হয়তো।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-vermutungen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Vielleicht ich komme morgen.","Vielleicht komme ich morgen.","Vielleicht morgen ich komme."],"answer":1,"explanation":"শুরুতে vielleicht, তারপর verb।"}]}